{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 6, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "免", "id": "免"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "殘", "id": "殘"}, {"form": "毀", "id": "毀"}, {"form": "為", "id": "爲"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.5198031240700023, "source": "免", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.672505263682799, "source": "免", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.7097313085754806, "source": "君", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.2789483924830263, "source": "君", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.789774016249017, "source": "君", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.789774016249017, "source": "君", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.3915714182207344, "source": "大", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 2.2670401555746342, "source": "大", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.8807457944547437, "source": "大", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.7562145318086435, "source": "大", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.2396908869280152, "source": "毀", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.2321210516182215, "source": "毀", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.4589311633847397, "source": "毀", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.7541830711463144, "source": "行", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.4589311633847397, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.053466055276575, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.5871289864831483, "source": "行", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 2.3158303197440664, "source": "政", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 3.2321210516182215, "sour